1
00:00:03,820 --> 00:00:04,650
Aaaaaaah!

2
00:00:12,540 --> 00:00:13,370
Goddammit!

3
00:00:13,580 --> 00:00:17,051
How could you let yourself give
in to the Synthesis ritual?

4
00:00:17,300 --> 00:00:19,640
You forget why you're a swordsman?

5
00:00:19,900 --> 00:00:23,371
Why you left Rulid and came
to Senator in the first place?

6
00:00:23,540 --> 00:00:24,980
You're here for Alice!

7
00:00:25,340 --> 00:00:27,869
You're here to take
her back home with you!

8
00:00:53,080 --> 00:00:54,080
I'm not a hero.

9
00:00:54,880 --> 00:00:55,762
I'm not a hero.

10
00:00:55,860 --> 00:00:56,690
It's not a hero.

11
00:00:56,773 --> 00:00:57,603
It's not a hero.

12
00:00:57,686 --> 00:01:01,277
Yeah, yeah, yeah,

13
00:01:01,360 --> 00:01:07,640
yeah, yeah, yeah, yeah.

14
00:01:35,720 --> 00:01:40,900
Let's get into it.

15
00:02:06,760 --> 00:02:09,477
Thank you

16
00:02:09,560 --> 00:02:16,560
so

17
00:02:27,220 --> 00:02:28,050
much

18
00:02:28,133 --> 00:02:28,963
for joining us today.

19
00:02:29,080 --> 00:02:32,380
Eugeo, you and me never
had a full-on fight before.

20
00:02:34,500 --> 00:02:36,560
I used to think about who'd win.

21
00:02:36,920 --> 00:02:40,096
If the day ever came, we got
to cross swords for real.

22
00:02:40,880 --> 00:02:45,500
To tell the truth, I knew you'd beat
me one day, but that ain't today.

23
00:02:48,340 --> 00:02:51,440
I'll show him a move he's
never seen me do before!

24
00:03:05,600 --> 00:03:06,660
Burst element.

25
00:03:17,640 --> 00:03:19,360
He is much too powerful.

26
00:03:19,720 --> 00:03:22,014
I doubt this one is really your friend.

27
00:03:22,100 --> 00:03:23,688
What are you talking about?

28
00:03:23,820 --> 00:03:27,467
If he's been synthesized, wouldn't
that make him super strong?

29
00:03:28,340 --> 00:03:29,657
That is true, however.

30
00:03:29,740 --> 00:03:31,460
Something is off about him.

31
00:03:32,040 --> 00:03:37,200
For one who only just became an Integrity
Knight, he seems too accustomed to battle.

32
00:03:38,000 --> 00:03:40,697
Incarnate arms and that
aerial element skill he just

33
00:03:40,780 --> 00:03:44,200
used are far too advanced for
a newcomer to have mastered.

34
00:03:47,160 --> 00:03:49,240
You should let me handle him.

35
00:03:51,060 --> 00:03:52,300
I got this.

36
00:04:02,160 --> 00:04:05,572
All right, buddy, when this
is over, I'll give you a name.

37
00:04:05,860 --> 00:04:07,625
Just help me get through this.

38
00:04:09,420 --> 00:04:10,760
En Kirito, Ugeo!

39
00:04:50,820 --> 00:04:52,380
A snappy move.

40
00:04:52,580 --> 00:04:53,420
He got a name?

41
00:04:54,300 --> 00:04:56,680
Blade style. Stormwave.

42
00:04:57,520 --> 00:04:58,350
Wait, Blade?

43
00:04:58,540 --> 00:05:00,600
As in Golgorosso, Blade?

44
00:05:00,920 --> 00:05:02,560
Yujiro, think back.

45
00:05:02,860 --> 00:05:06,095
Do you remember the guy that
taught you how to do that?

46
00:05:06,360 --> 00:05:08,380
I don't, and I don't care.

47
00:05:08,740 --> 00:05:11,420
The only person I need to remember is her.

48
00:05:11,960 --> 00:05:14,000
She is the reason I use my sword.

49
00:05:14,380 --> 00:05:16,480
I exist to eliminate her enemies.

50
00:05:18,860 --> 00:05:22,900
He's got a crystal in his head,
just like Eldrie and Alice.

51
00:05:23,540 --> 00:05:28,340
Once the piety module is inserted, it
effectively blocks the links to memories.

52
00:05:28,820 --> 00:05:33,260
With that, the prospective knight's
past is sealed away. The result?

53
00:05:33,520 --> 00:05:38,000
A knight who is loyal to the Church
and to their creator, the Pontifex.

54
00:05:38,600 --> 00:05:40,640
What memories are being blocked?

55
00:05:40,940 --> 00:05:44,860
If I can figure it out and
remind him, he'll snap out of it.

56
00:05:45,220 --> 00:05:49,160
No, it'll take more than words
to break Administrator's spell.

57
00:05:50,740 --> 00:05:52,797
I'll pour my heart into my sword.

58
00:05:52,880 --> 00:05:53,937
That'll reach him!

59
00:05:54,020 --> 00:05:55,820
Hell, it's better.

60
00:05:58,220 --> 00:05:59,050
QG!

61
00:06:04,580 --> 00:06:07,977
I'm gonna force you to remember
everyone you cared about.

62
00:06:08,060 --> 00:06:10,377
Back in Ruin, there's
a girl waiting for you.

63
00:06:10,460 --> 00:06:11,517
Her name's Selka.

64
00:06:11,600 --> 00:06:15,177
At the Swordcraft Academy,
Google Rosa was your mentor.

65
00:06:15,260 --> 00:06:16,217
And Lina was mine.

66
00:06:16,300 --> 00:06:17,797
And Tiese and Ronier.

67
00:06:17,880 --> 00:06:19,617
Remember when we last saw him?

68
00:06:19,700 --> 00:06:20,880
Come on, man!

69
00:06:21,160 --> 00:06:23,440
You gotta remember why you came here!

70
00:06:23,620 --> 00:06:25,480
It's to take Alice back home!

71
00:06:32,460 --> 00:06:33,660
Remember, damn it!

72
00:07:10,040 --> 00:07:11,060
Yu-Gi-Oh!

73
00:07:25,780 --> 00:07:26,920
Alice.

74
00:07:27,540 --> 00:07:29,800
Do you remember her?

75
00:07:33,840 --> 00:07:36,060
U-U-U-Gio.

76
00:07:39,220 --> 00:07:40,620
Watch out!

77
00:07:43,520 --> 00:07:45,300
Enhance armament.

78
00:07:57,660 --> 00:07:59,980
Yucho, why?

79
00:08:32,080 --> 00:08:37,140
I trust you took care of those
despicable traitors, number 32.

80
00:08:37,860 --> 00:08:41,000
I have them both trapped
in ice, Prime Senator, sir.

81
00:08:41,320 --> 00:08:42,673
They can't go anywhere.

82
00:08:42,880 --> 00:08:43,940
You don't say!

83
00:08:44,380 --> 00:08:46,097
That's all well and good, my boy.

84
00:08:46,180 --> 00:08:49,220
But you did not finish them off, did you?

85
00:08:50,420 --> 00:08:53,060
No, Prime Senator, I did not.

86
00:08:53,640 --> 00:08:57,875
My orders from the Pontifex were to
stop the traitors, not to kill them.

87
00:08:58,080 --> 00:08:58,960
That won't do!

88
00:08:59,100 --> 00:09:00,600
That simply won't do!

89
00:09:00,820 --> 00:09:04,220
And when you speak to me,
you call me Your Excellency!

90
00:09:04,520 --> 00:09:07,020
Do not forget that again, Number 32,

91
00:09:07,380 --> 00:09:11,660
because if you do, I will punish
you by turning you into a horse.

92
00:09:11,860 --> 00:09:16,640
And then I shall ride on your back,
shouting, Giddy-up, little horsey! Giddy-up!

93
00:09:19,060 --> 00:09:22,940
I'll finish them off and show
her eminence who's more loyal.

94
00:09:26,140 --> 00:09:26,970
Ha!

95
00:09:35,760 --> 00:09:37,580
I have returned, my lady.

96
00:09:38,640 --> 00:09:40,560
Welcome back, Yu-Gi-Oh.

97
00:09:41,220 --> 00:09:44,840
Did you complete the task I gave you? Yes.

98
00:09:45,880 --> 00:09:46,710
Well done.

99
00:09:47,000 --> 00:09:48,500
You deserve a reward.

100
00:09:48,920 --> 00:09:50,626
Come, climb into bed with me.

101
00:09:58,420 --> 00:09:59,460
All right.

102
00:09:59,820 --> 00:10:03,400
As promised, I shall give
you your heart's desire.

103
00:10:05,200 --> 00:10:07,660
Love for you, and you alone.

104
00:10:09,300 --> 00:10:10,130
Yes.

105
00:10:11,480 --> 00:10:14,220
First, I should do
something about that wound

106
00:10:19,100 --> 00:10:23,140
Now then, let me have a
look at your face again

107
00:10:24,540 --> 00:10:28,840
I found an odd gap in your memory,
and that is where I put the module

108
00:10:29,860 --> 00:10:32,919
Convenient, but I should
not have rushed the process

109
00:10:33,220 --> 00:10:38,520
I'll re-synthesize you properly And then
after that, you shall have your reward

110
00:10:42,120 --> 00:10:43,840
Oh, my God.

111
00:11:10,660 --> 00:11:13,060
Be a good boy and stay still.

112
00:11:18,100 --> 00:11:21,600
This module is a vast
improvement over the old ones.

113
00:11:21,880 --> 00:11:27,480
It bolsters the imagination and unlocks
advanced arts like incarnate arms.

114
00:11:31,020 --> 00:11:33,900
Now relax and show me your memories again.

115
00:11:34,200 --> 00:11:38,340
And this time, I'll insert it into
the memory you hold most dear.

116
00:11:39,640 --> 00:11:42,280
You can't move, but you may speak.

117
00:11:42,660 --> 00:11:44,697
Now, chant the spell I taught you.

118
00:11:44,780 --> 00:11:45,740
Go on.

119
00:11:46,280 --> 00:11:48,751
Don't tell me you've forgotten it already.

120
00:11:48,900 --> 00:11:50,240
Oh, you silly thing.

121
00:11:51,160 --> 00:11:53,560
Remove core protection.

122
00:12:08,340 --> 00:12:09,540
How dare you!

123
00:12:43,860 --> 00:12:45,980
I see you regained your senses.

124
00:12:46,380 --> 00:12:48,145
I can't believe you fooled me.

125
00:12:50,880 --> 00:12:54,900
I assume the little brat from the
library gave you that knife, yes?

126
00:12:56,560 --> 00:12:58,000
Stab me all you want.

127
00:12:58,220 --> 00:12:59,840
I am impervious to it.

128
00:13:00,260 --> 00:13:02,600
No metal object can pierce my skin.

129
00:13:04,160 --> 00:13:07,277
You poor child, to reject
the promise I made!

130
00:13:07,360 --> 00:13:12,117
All you had to do was give yourself to
me and I would love you back in return!

131
00:13:12,200 --> 00:13:14,797
The kind of love you sought all your life!

132
00:13:14,880 --> 00:13:17,157
Eternal love, eternal control!

133
00:13:17,240 --> 00:13:20,380
And you chose to reject it like this!

134
00:13:22,640 --> 00:13:27,977
Eternal love, eternal control!

135
00:13:28,060 --> 00:13:29,817
That's right, Eugeo!

136
00:13:29,900 --> 00:13:31,840
If you give yourself to me,

137
00:13:32,060 --> 00:13:35,657
that thirst you've been suffering
from would be instantly quenched,

138
00:13:35,740 --> 00:13:40,120
and all the confusion and fear you
harbored for so long would disappear.

139
00:13:41,140 --> 00:13:43,700
But I shall give you one more chance.

140
00:13:44,040 --> 00:13:46,600
Take your sword and smash that toy.

141
00:13:47,080 --> 00:13:52,440
Do that, and I shall forgive your sins
and shower you with the bounty of my love.

142
00:13:54,380 --> 00:13:58,420
To love is to control
and to be controlled.

143
00:14:00,920 --> 00:14:04,332
If that is how you think of
it, then I feel sorry for you.

144
00:14:05,940 --> 00:14:07,800
Maybe that's how you feel.

145
00:14:08,460 --> 00:14:12,340
Starved for love, looking all
over and never finding it.

146
00:14:13,380 --> 00:14:15,380
But love isn't about control,

147
00:14:15,680 --> 00:14:19,092
and you don't give it to get
something like a transaction.

148
00:14:19,300 --> 00:14:23,100
You give it selflessly, like
you give water to a flower.

149
00:14:23,500 --> 00:14:24,340
That's love.

150
00:14:24,500 --> 00:14:25,559
Real, honest love.

151
00:14:27,840 --> 00:14:28,960
What a shame.

152
00:14:29,400 --> 00:14:33,400
I wanted to forgive you for your
treasonous acts against the church.

153
00:14:33,500 --> 00:14:35,540
I wanted to save your soul.

154
00:14:35,880 --> 00:14:38,160
And this is how you speak to me.

155
00:14:43,300 --> 00:14:47,140
I could drain your life and turn
you into a jewel if I wanted,

156
00:14:47,380 --> 00:14:48,909
but that would be a waste.

157
00:14:49,060 --> 00:14:53,537
Instead, I'll synthesize you
by force, like her. You mean…

158
00:14:53,620 --> 00:14:58,060
That's right, sweet number 30,
the one you're so infatuated with.

159
00:14:58,300 --> 00:15:00,377
She also refused to chant the spell,

160
00:15:00,460 --> 00:15:04,695
and it took the automated senator's
days to disable her core protection.

161
00:15:04,920 --> 00:15:05,860
You monsters!

162
00:15:06,300 --> 00:15:07,880
I didn't actually see it.

163
00:15:08,000 --> 00:15:08,920
I was asleep.

164
00:15:09,960 --> 00:15:12,820
I'm sure it was agonizing for her.

165
00:15:14,440 --> 00:15:15,360
Oh well.

166
00:15:15,700 --> 00:15:19,100
In the end, you too will
suffer the same experience.

167
00:15:28,040 --> 00:15:32,440
I will break through!

168
00:16:03,780 --> 00:16:05,160
That sword.

169
00:16:06,220 --> 00:16:08,740
Oh, now I see.

170
00:16:13,120 --> 00:16:14,400
Save me!

171
00:16:16,800 --> 00:16:18,480
Please, your eminence!

172
00:16:18,640 --> 00:16:20,120
I need assistance here!

173
00:16:21,760 --> 00:16:23,180
You traitor!

174
00:16:23,620 --> 00:16:25,957
This little bastard
betrayed you, your eminence!

175
00:16:26,040 --> 00:16:28,577
He said he trapped Number
30 and that other rogue!

176
00:16:28,660 --> 00:16:30,080
But he didn't even…

177
00:16:32,200 --> 00:16:33,280
Let go! Let go!

178
00:16:45,600 --> 00:16:46,430
Kirito…

179
00:16:54,840 --> 00:16:56,400
What's up, Yu-Gi-Oh?

180
00:17:05,240 --> 00:17:06,070
Sorry.

181
00:17:06,360 --> 00:17:11,360
I gave in to Administrator's
temptation and tried to kill you both.

182
00:17:11,660 --> 00:17:14,940
I wanted to sacrifice
myself to atone for it.

183
00:17:15,140 --> 00:17:16,877
I knew that's what you were going for.

184
00:17:16,960 --> 00:17:20,195
We've been friends so long,
I can read you like a book.

185
00:17:21,380 --> 00:17:23,580
You never change, do you?

186
00:17:27,280 --> 00:17:28,240
Alice.

187
00:17:42,400 --> 00:17:43,880
Is that her?

188
00:17:44,680 --> 00:17:46,920
Administrator? Yes.

189
00:17:47,900 --> 00:17:51,060
She looks the same as
she did six years ago.

190
00:17:51,780 --> 00:17:55,427
Bercouli and Fanatio were just
about due for me to reset them.

191
00:17:55,600 --> 00:17:58,360
But you, Alice, I've
only had you for what?

192
00:17:58,580 --> 00:17:59,700
Six years now?

193
00:17:59,940 --> 00:18:02,999
Your logic circuits don't
seem to be malfunctioning.

194
00:18:03,180 --> 00:18:07,100
Perhaps that irregular unit
is influencing you. Hmm.

195
00:18:09,040 --> 00:18:10,320
What is it, Alice?

196
00:18:10,600 --> 00:18:13,557
If you wish to say something
to me, then just say it.

197
00:18:13,640 --> 00:18:14,997
I won't get mad.

198
00:18:15,080 --> 00:18:17,340
Please, speak your mind.

199
00:18:29,920 --> 00:18:31,540
I will, Your Eminence.

200
00:18:32,020 --> 00:18:36,320
As of today, the proud Order of
the Integrity Knights has fallen.

201
00:18:37,540 --> 00:18:40,877
All it took to bring it down
were the swords of the two

202
00:18:40,960 --> 00:18:44,820
rebels at my side and the
obsession and deceit of your rule.

203
00:18:45,080 --> 00:18:47,140
Represented by this cathedral,

204
00:18:47,520 --> 00:18:50,220
my duty is not to protect the church,

205
00:18:50,580 --> 00:18:53,756
but to protect the innocent
and safeguard their peace.

206
00:18:54,160 --> 00:18:57,300
It is your actions,
more than anything else,

207
00:18:57,640 --> 00:19:01,522
which threaten the well-being of
the citizens of the human empire.

208
00:19:03,500 --> 00:19:04,330
You!

209
00:19:04,420 --> 00:19:05,840
Shut your mouth!

210
00:19:06,180 --> 00:19:07,180
How dare I?

211
00:19:07,320 --> 00:19:09,900
Duty, you say, you broken toy? Ha!

212
00:19:10,320 --> 00:19:14,257
You knights are nothing more than
dolls, and your duty as you put it...

213
00:19:14,340 --> 00:19:18,057
Fascinating it isn't a
logic circuit error after

214
00:19:18,140 --> 00:19:21,760
all and her piety module
is still functioning.

215
00:19:22,600 --> 00:19:26,017
Which means she must have
disabled the code 871

216
00:19:26,100 --> 00:19:29,120
that was installed for
me by her own volition.

217
00:19:29,700 --> 00:19:33,137
Rather than by sudden
emotion that thing in her

218
00:19:33,220 --> 00:19:37,457
eyes called code 871 i
won't know how it happened.

219
00:19:37,540 --> 00:19:39,140
until I run an analysis.

220
00:19:40,600 --> 00:19:42,600
Now then. Chudelkin.

221
00:19:43,540 --> 00:19:46,397
Since I am generous, I
shall give you the chance.

222
00:19:46,480 --> 00:19:48,598
to restore your tattered reputation.

223
00:19:48,980 --> 00:19:51,800
Use your sacred arts and
deal with those three.

224
00:19:55,420 --> 00:19:58,380
But your reminence, your gloriousness!

225
00:19:58,740 --> 00:20:00,060
Yes, what is it?

226
00:20:02,120 --> 00:20:06,497
For the first and only time in
my many years of service to you,

227
00:20:06,580 --> 00:20:09,877
I would like to present you
with a most imputant request.

228
00:20:09,960 --> 00:20:13,313
I shall happily risk my life
annihilating these traitors.

229
00:20:13,500 --> 00:20:17,780
However, once I have fulfilled
your wishes, would you, would you?

230
00:20:18,360 --> 00:20:22,177
Would you let me touch your
exalted body and kiss your lips?

231
00:20:22,260 --> 00:20:25,020
and spend one magical
night alone with you?

232
00:20:25,420 --> 00:20:26,880
Please, please!

233
00:20:27,440 --> 00:20:31,120
I would be most grateful if
you granted me such a delight!

234
00:20:35,320 --> 00:20:37,137
Very well, Chudelkin.

235
00:20:37,220 --> 00:20:40,097
I swear to the goddess Stacia.

236
00:20:40,180 --> 00:20:42,657
As soon as you have
fulfilled your mission!

237
00:20:42,740 --> 00:20:45,217
My body will be yours for the taking.

238
00:20:45,300 --> 00:20:48,140
Every inch for one night?

239
00:20:51,040 --> 00:20:53,777
Words cannot express the
joy you've brought me.

240
00:20:53,860 --> 00:20:55,400
Your exalted holiness.

241
00:20:56,200 --> 00:21:00,400
And I swear to you, I will
not let you down! Huh?

242
00:21:00,860 --> 00:21:03,060
I am resolute and energized!

243
00:21:03,600 --> 00:21:06,740
I am motivated and I am invincible!

244
00:21:09,700 --> 00:21:11,940
System Call!

245
00:21:14,540 --> 00:21:18,217
Generate Thermal Element!

246
00:21:18,300 --> 00:21:19,860
Burn it!

247
00:21:27,900 --> 00:21:32,980
Now I will show you my
greatest sacred art!

248
00:21:33,780 --> 00:21:35,200
Come forth, genie!

249
00:21:35,460 --> 00:21:37,480
And burn these traitors!

250
00:21:37,760 --> 00:21:39,160
To watch!

251
00:22:56,820 --> 00:22:57,837
Oh,

252
00:22:57,920 --> 00:22:59,517
everything turns to dust to

253
00:22:59,600 --> 00:23:06,600
dust

254
00:23:13,220 --> 00:23:14,050
When I fall

255
00:23:14,133 --> 00:23:16,000
into the ground

256
00:23:16,520 --> 00:23:21,220
I'll see if the flowers
will bloom Like I'll bloom

257
00:23:22,560 --> 00:23:24,260
So give me no

258
00:23:35,520 --> 00:23:38,580
Next time, Titan of the Sword
